                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Data from Eitelberg, D.A., van Vliet, J. & Verburg, P.H. (2014). A review of global potentially available cropland estimates and their consequences for model-based assessments. Global Change Biology. 21(3): 1236-1248\n\nBased on a synthesis of the assumptions underlying current global estimates of cropland availability we constructed maps of a high, a medium, and a low estimate that are representative of the range of estimates in the studies reviewed for this research."
